  "notes": [
    "Pinned OCI SDK contract: CreateJmsPlugin and UpdateJmsPlugin return a JmsPlugin body immediately, GetJmsPlugin returns the resource body, ListJmsPlugins paginates through opc-next-page, DeleteJmsPlugin returns no body, and fleet-less registration creates an INACTIVE plugin.",
    "Reviewed jms/jmsplugin row keeps repo-authored lifecycle classification: ACTIVE and INACTIVE are the only published steady success states, no provisioning or updating buckets are published, DELETED is a delete-confirmation target, and NEEDS_ATTENTION stays outside the success set.",
    "Pre-create reuse and delete confirmation are repo-authored: existing-before-create lookup exhausts paginated ListJmsPlugins responses and adopts only a unique exact compartmentId plus agentId match; delete retains the finalizer until GetJmsPlugin or fallback ListJmsPlugins returns DELETED or NotFound.",
    "Repo-authored mutable drift is limited to fleetId, freeformTags, and definedTags. agentId, agentType, and compartmentId remain replacement-only, and detaching a plugin from a fleet stays out of scope because the published spec cannot distinguish omission from clear."
